HyperPrecisionMaple
Copyright (C) 2026 NAKANO Ryuosuke and contributors

This package implements the method described in:

  Sumit Banik and Souvik Bera,
  "HyperPrecision: A Mathematica package for High-Precision Numerical
  Evaluation of Multivariate Hypergeometric Functions,"
  Computer Physics Communications 328 (2026), 110328,
  arXiv:2605.30216v2.

The reference Mathematica implementation is available from
https://github.com/HyperPrecision/HyperPrecision under GPL-3.0.

This repository is a separate Maple reimplementation. It does not include the
Mathematica source files, FiniteFlow, DESolver, or AMFlow.

OpenAI Codex contributed to the initial Maple implementation, tests, and
documentation.
